# Components

Shared controls live in `packages/ui/src/components/MNBName/` and are exported from `packages/ui/src/index.ts`. Apps import `MNBName` from `@mnb/ui`. Read `packages/ui/.instructions.md` before adding one.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import type { MNBButtonProps } from './MNBButton.type.ts';
	import { MNBButtonVariantEnum } from './MNBButton.enum.ts';

	let {
		variant = MNBButtonVariantEnum.DEFAULT,
		children,
		class: classes = '',
		...props
	}: MNBButtonProps = $props();

	const baseClasses = $derived(['mnb-button', variant, classes].filter(Boolean).join(' '));
</script>
```

- Props live in `MNBName.type.ts`. Rename `class` to `classes`
- Root class is `mnb-*`. Parts are short names (`label`, `header`). Variants are separate classes (`primary`). No BEM
- Snippets for optional regions (`header`, `footer`, `actions`), as `MNBCard` and `MNBModal` do
- Styles use tokens: `var(--mnb-space-sm)`, `var(--mnb-color-ink)`, `var(--mnb-shadow-sm)`
- No new hex colors, no raw box-shadows, no `font-family` outside the token set
- Interactive elements are real `<button>`, `<a>`, and `<input>` elements. Focus uses `:focus-visible`. Loading sets `aria-busy`. Errors use `role="alert"`
- Do not put Hygraph, Mistral, or TIDAL calls in a component. Receive data through props or page `data`
- Do not import `$env` in a package. Apps pass values in

Page-only markup can stay in the route. Promote it to `packages/ui` when a second page needs the same control.
